SMRFORGE trust root
===================
The public key that SMRFORGE evidence bundles are signed with. To confirm a
bundle's origin, check that the fingerprint printed by `smrforge verify` matches
the value below AND matches at least one other independent channel (the DNS TXT
record at smrforge-trust-root.smrforge.io) before relying on it.

